**INFORMATION SECURITY SOLUTION S.A.LE MANAGER - HO CHI MINH **

We are looking for a proactive professional to join a major software solutions vendor as Information Security Solutions S.a.les Manager for their office in Vietnam. The focus of the role is selling the solutions portfolio and stablishing the company's brand in the Vietnamese market.

**Requirements:**

• Experience in selling information security solutions in the B2B or B2G business segments for at least 3 years;

• Experience in the role of Sale and Presale manager (experience in both roles) on complex information security projects or in the area of information security services (in particular, Security Operation Center (SOC)) is welcome;

• Good knowledge of global information security solutions, their capabilities, strengths and weaknesses. Certificates in information security products (Pre-sale Engineer level) are desirable;

• General knowledge in the field of IT infrastructure solutions, server virtualization, containerization and networks;

• Experience in project sales to enterprise customers is mandatory.

**Conditions:**

• Opportunity to realize your potential and ambitions in a global public IT company;

• Registration in accordance with the labor legislation of Vietnam;

• Salary + quarterly and annual bonuses upon fulfillment of relevant sales plans and operational indicators.

